# TODO List: Refactoring Services to Use System Settings

## 📊 Summary of Current State

✅ **COMPLETED (State Services)** - Already refactored to use `system.js`:
- `stateServices/Customer.js`
- `stateServices/LoyaltyTransaction.js`
- `stateServices/SaleStateService.js`
- `stateServices/ReturnRefundStateService.js`
- `stateServices/Notification.js`
- `stateServices/Supplier.js`

⏳ **PENDING (Regular Services)** - Need refactoring to use `system.js`:
- All services in `src/services/` directory

