## 🎯 Refactoring Todo List

### 1. **AuditLog.js** (`src/services/AuditLog.js`)

**Issue:** Uses hardcoded `auditLogger` and `logger` without checking if audit logging is enabled via settings.

**Changes Needed:**
```javascript
// Add at top
const system = require("../utils/system");

// In create() method - check if audit logging is enabled
async create(data, user = "system", qr = null) {
  // ✅ Add this check
  const auditEnabled = await system.auditLogEnabled();
  if (!auditEnabled) {
    logger.debug("[AuditLog] Audit logging is disabled, skipping");
    return null;
  }
  // ... rest of the code
}

// In findAll() - use logRetentionDays for filtering old logs
async findAll(options = {}, qr = null) {
  // ✅ Add default date filter based on retention
  if (!options.startDate && !options.endDate) {
    const retentionDays = await system.logRetentionDays();
    const startDate = new Date();
    startDate.setDate(startDate.getDate() - retentionDays);
    options.startDate = startDate.toISOString();
  }
  // ... rest of the code
}
```

